### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "test",
  "password": "1234"
}
### 회원가입 2
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "test2",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 항상 로그인 먼저 (세션 유지)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "test",
  "password": "1234"
}
### 로그인 2
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "test2",
  "password": "1234"
}
### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### 내 프로필 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json

### 다른 사용자의 프로필 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/1/profile
Content-Type: application/json

### 단일 태그 검색
GET http://localhost:3000/search?q=한식
Content-Type: application/json

### 다중 태그 검색
GET http://localhost:3000/search?q=바다 제주
Content-Type: application/json

### 검색어 없이 요청 (400 error expected)
GET http://localhost:3000/search
Content-Type: application/json

### 게시물 업로드
POST http://localhost:3000/post/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test_cat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_images/test_cat.jpg
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

다솜이
--MyBoundary-- 

### 게시물 업로드 (discription, category, tag) 구현 확인
POST http://localhost:3000/post/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test_sushi.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_images/test_sushi.jpg
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

일본 여행 기념
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

일본에서 스시를 머것서요
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

일식
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

일식 일본 여행 감성 맛집

--MyBoundary--

### 전체 게시물 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/post/
Content-Type: application/json

### 특정 태그로 게시물 조회 (tag_name 기반)
GET http://localhost:3000/tag/name/매운맛/posts
Content-Type: application/json

### 특정 태그로 게시물 조회 (tag_id 기반)
GET http://localhost:3000/tag/1/posts
Content-Type: application/json


### 게시물 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/post/3

### 게시물 수정
PUT http://localhost:3000/post/12
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

어디 바다일까요
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

경치를 먹는다 이것또한 한식
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

한식
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

제주 바다 경치
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test_beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_images/test_beach.jpg
--MyBoundary--


